  ('16.1 Basic rock collection', 'Kit component: (10) Numbered /rock Samples; granite, rhyolite, sandstone, limestone, basalt, gabbro, marble, Coquina, chalk & shale. | Packing: box made of plastic or wood with Smooth and safe edges | Purity: All Samples show typical feature. | size: Size about (7.5 ×10 cm) approx. | legend & user guide: ID numbers for each sample installed on the samples it selves. The user guide is installed on the box and indicate the number of the sample and its name in both Arabic and English'),
  ('16.2 A Mineral Set of Hardness', 'Kit component: (9) Numbered Samples; Talc, Gypsum, Calcite, Fluorite, Apatite, Orthoclase, Quartz, Topaz, and Corundum. With streak plate (5 cm x 2.5 cm), magnet, glass slide & copper strip. | Packing: box made of plastic or wood with Smooth and safe edges | Purity: All Samples are pure crystalline | Size: Size about 5 cm x 5 cm) approx. | legend & user guide: ID numbers for each sample installed on the samples it selves. The user guide is installed on the box and indicate the number of the sample and its name in both Arabic and English'),
  ('16.3 A Set of Clastic Sedimentary Rocks', 'Kit component: include (7) rocks numbered samples as the following; Conglomerate, breccia, Sandstone, Silt stone, Mudstone., Shale, marl | Packing: box made of plastic or wood with Smooth and safe edges | Purity: All Samples Show Typical Features | Size: Size about (7.5cm×10cm) approx. | legend & user guide: ID numbers for each sample installed on the samples it selves. The user guide is installed on the box and indicate the number of the sample and its name in both Arabic and English'),
  ('16.4 Model of Earth Internal Structure', 'Model Features: Removable parts showing the curst, mantle, lithosphere, and asthenosphere, inner and outer core with moho and Gutenberg discontinuities (the model should show name of all parts). | Dimension: Minimum Size about 40 cm diameter and 50 cm high. | Material: unbreakable plastic | Legend: identification list included both Arabic and English'),
  ('16.5 Geological Map of Jordan', 'Map Subject: Major geological divisions of the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan, according to the geological eras and ages. | Dimension: Min. subject area ( 100 cm ×70 cm) approx. | Material: Made of hard paper or carton Coated with a transparent layer and a buffer with suitable case | Legend: Tags, parts and explanations that are installed on the map should be in Arabic.'),
  ('16.6 Geologic Time Scale', 'Map / chart subject: Showing major eras, periods, epochs, and stages, according to scale. Learn the division of earth history, with major life forms each time, also the scale must show images for index fossils for each era. | Dimension: Min. subject area (100cm×70 cm) approx. | Material: Made of hard paper or carton Coated with a transparent layer and a buffer with suitable case | Legend: Tags, parts and explanations that are installed on the map should be in Arabic.'),
  ('16.7 Globe model', 'Features: Clear Geographical Details: It displays readable details along with vibrant colors that show names of countries as well as oceans, lakes, rivers and other natural wonders that you can easily pinpoint. This globe model can be rotated is 360 degree around its axis. Made of strong Plastic, and have strong plastic base. | Size of each model: 60 cm dimeter, 70cm high. | legend & user guide: With identification list included a detailed user''s guide in both Arabic and English with suitable case.'),
  ('16.8 anemometer', 'Model Features: A hand held anemometer that measures wind speed in m/s, knots, and beaufort scale. Measuer both high and low wind speed. Temperature in C /°F with wind chill calculation. LCD Backlight with battery included. Measuring ranges: Wind speed minimum 0.2 m/s maximum 30 m/s. Temperature range: -30 to +60°C and equivalent in °F | Dimension: 140 x 50 x 18mm. | Material: unbreakable plastic | Legend: identification list included both Arabic and English'),
  ('16.9 wet and dry bulb thermometer', 'Model Features: Comprises two al-choli thermometer tubes graduated -15 to +50°C mounted in plastic case. One thermometer bulb is covered with a muslin wick connected to a water reservoir which keeps it moist Supplied with hygrometric tables on its face. | Dimension: 300 x 110 mm | Material: Glasses | Legend: identification list included both Arabic and English')
